# Bounty descriptions and item names
salvage-bounty-description-ore-gold = Refined gold sells for top dollar in the inner colonies. Bring us a haul.
salvage-bounty-item-ore-gold = gold ore

salvage-bounty-description-ore-silver = Silver's needed for the next batch of medical equipment. Don't ask why.
salvage-bounty-item-ore-silver = silver ore

salvage-bounty-description-ore-plasma = Plasma keeps the lights on. Mine it before the lizards melt it down.
salvage-bounty-item-ore-plasma = plasma ore

salvage-bounty-description-ore-uranium = R&D wants uranium for "research." Don't drop it.
salvage-bounty-item-ore-uranium = uranium ore

salvage-bounty-description-ore-haul = A bulk shipment of mixed ore for industrial processing. Quantity over quality.
salvage-bounty-item-ore-haul = mixed ore

salvage-bounty-description-artifact = An intact xenoarchaeological artifact. Handle with care, or don't.
salvage-bounty-item-artifact = xeno artifact

salvage-bounty-description-carp-teeth = Local cuisine, apparently. The fewer carp swimming around, the better.
salvage-bounty-item-carp-teeth = space carp tooth

salvage-bounty-description-research-disks = Recovered tech from old labs. Spin them for what they're worth.
salvage-bounty-item-research-disks = technology disk

salvage-bounty-description-ore-bananium = Hilariously valuable. Don't slip on the way back.
salvage-bounty-item-ore-bananium = bananium ore

salvage-bounty-description-bedsheets = The medbay tents are wearing thin. Bring linens.
salvage-bounty-item-bedsheets = bedsheet

salvage-bounty-description-anomaly-core = An intact anomaly core. Containment included, hopefully.
salvage-bounty-item-anomaly-core = anomaly core

salvage-bounty-description-organs = The morgue stocks are dry. Any organs will do, we're not picky.
salvage-bounty-item-organs = organ

salvage-bounty-description-lungs = Specifically lungs. The xenobiologist insists.
salvage-bounty-item-lungs = lung

salvage-bounty-description-batteries = Power cells of any size. Salvage tech runs on them.
salvage-bounty-item-batteries = battery

salvage-bounty-description-toolboxes = Toolboxes for the next expedition. Empty or filled, we don't mind.
salvage-bounty-item-toolboxes = toolbox

salvage-bounty-description-knives = Utility knives for skinning, gutting, or whatever the salvage crew needs.
salvage-bounty-item-knives = knife

salvage-bounty-description-scrap = Loose metal scrap from old wrecks. The forge will chew through it.
salvage-bounty-item-scrap = salvage scrap

salvage-bounty-description-meat = Whatever you killed out there, we'll smoke it. Bring meat in bulk.
salvage-bounty-item-meat = meat

salvage-bounty-description-trash = Pick up the planet a little. Janitorial pays per bag.
salvage-bounty-item-trash = trash
